      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let\u0027s just fix things up here instead of editing each test individually.\n\nWe should also special-case the RKP VM instance, so _only_ it is allowed to return unsupported. We never want \"default\" or \"strongbox\" to ever report unsupported for any calls.\n\nI _think_ this is as simple as:\n```\n::ndk::ScoptedAStatus status \u003d provisionable_-\u003egetHardwareInfo(\u0026rpcHardwareInfo);\nif (GetParam() \u003d\u003d RKP_VM_INSTANCE_NAME \u0026\u0026 status.getExceptionCode() \u003d\u003d EX_UNSUPPORTED_OPERATION) {\n  GTEST_SKIP() \u003c\u003c \"The RKP VM is not supported on this system.\"\n}\nASSERT_TRUE(status.isOk());\n```",
      "revId": "e7ff4affb58315f22b419af50b5f031716bac643",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
